    <x:String x:Key="Pack.Loader.LeviLamina.Desc">A Bedrock Edition mod loader developed by LeviMC</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Pack.Loader.LeviLamina.Intro">A native Bedrock Edition mod loader developed by the LiteLDev community. It injects into the game before process startup via PreLoader, allowing you to install and run native mods on the Bedrock client. BedrockBoot manages this loader's mods centrally in the instance's mod management page.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Pack.Loader.PreLoader.CannotInstall">You cannot install this loader</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Pack.Loader.PreLoader.CannotRemove">You cannot remove this loader</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Pack.Loader.PreLoader.Desc">BedrockBoot vanilla loader (PreLoad.NET)</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Pack.Loader.PreLoader.Intro">BedrockBoot's built-in vanilla mod loader (PreLoad.NET). It automatically injects preload and injection mods managed by BedrockBoot before the game process starts, providing basic mod-loading capability for the instance. This loader is built into every instance, requires no separate installation, and cannot be removed.</x:String>
